data: {"id": "3dd0460d95444370-thinking-parallel_evidence-862", "run_id": "3dd0460d95444370", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已获取到关键证据。让我分析：\n\n**支持的证据：**\n1. **kubectl_previous_logs** 显示：Pod 崩溃前最后日志是 24 次成功的 `/work` HTTP 请求，每次请求内存增加 2 MiB（从 2 到 48 MiB），最后崩溃。**这直接表明 crash 是在内存逐渐增长到约 48 MiB 时发生的**\n2. **kubectl_describe** 显示：exitCode=137（OOMKilled），reason=OOMKilled，Reason=CrashLoopBackOff\n3. **kubectl_get_yaml** 显示：restarts=13，reason=CrashLoopBackOff，exitCode=137，message: \"back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app\"\n4. **execute_pod_promql** 显示：restart 从 0 增长到 13，确认了持续重启\n5. **query_pod_topology** 确认 Pod 在 node2，IP 172.1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788801982229, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

