data: {"id": "3dd0460d95444370-thinking-parallel_evidence-1856", "run_id": "3dd0460d95444370", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence collected for `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr`.\n\n**Key Facts from Evidence:**\n\n1. **Pod Status (kubectl_get_yaml):**\n   - Phase: Running (but this is the Pod phase, not container)\n   - Container 'app': ready=False, restarts=13, reason=CrashLoopBackOff, exitCode=137\n   - Message: \"back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app\"\n   - Last State Terminated Reason: OOMKilled, Exit Code: 137\n   - Memory Limit: 64Mi, Request: 24Mi\n   - Container image: `xnet.registr", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788802038874, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

