data: {"id": "3dd0460d95444370-final", "run_id": "3dd0460d95444370", "seq": 1861, "ts_ms": 1788802057816, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | CrashLoopBackOff | 应用 `/work` 接口持续线性分配内存至 48 MiB，超过容器内存上限 64 MiB 导致 OOMKilled |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff (fact-486a0a17913a) | 证实容器进入异常重启循环状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: OOMKilled (fact-e69144302359) | 确证容器被系统杀死，非应用主动退出 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.last_exit_code: 137 (fact-1d98b148be66) | 配合 OOMKilled 确认资源耗尽导致的进程终止 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: 64Mi (fact-07bbb43ffa02) | 提供触发 OOM 的硬限制阈值事实 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `/work` 接口请求 `allocated_mib` 从 14MiB 线性增长至 48MiB (fact-logging-pattern) | 提供内存分配持续增长的具体证据 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow | L7 Flow: 9次 `GET /work` 返回 200 (fact-tracing-flow) | 证明异常调用发生在应用层且服务正常响应 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: 1 (OOMKilled)` (fact-55826cdafe4f) | Metric 维度确认最后的终止原因为 OOM |\n\n**证据关联与印证：**\nLogging 中 `/work` 接口内存分配的线性增长（事实 5）直接解释了为何在 64MiB 限制（事实 4）下触发 OOMKilled（事实 2）。Tracing（事实 6）进一步将异常调用与 `/work` 路径关联。Kubernetes 状态（事实 1, 3）与 Metric（事实 7）互相印证了该状态并非偶发，而是持续存在的 CrashLoopBackOff 结果。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用逻辑在 /work 路径持续线性增加内存分配 → 累积内存使用触发容器硬限制 (64MiB) → 内核执行 OOM Kill 终止容器 (Exit 137) → Pod CrashLoopBackOff 持续重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用内存分配超出容器限制**。\n\n证据表明：应用通过 `/work` 接口持续分配内存（Logging 显示分配量从 14MiB 升至 48MiB），最终触及 64MiB 的容器内存硬限制（K8s Config），导致内核 OOM Killer 介入终止进程（K8s State/OOMKilled/Exit 137）。Metric 与 K8s 事件状态证实该进程终止反复发生，进而导致 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 133.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 133.2s (Evidence 124.6s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 166.326, "metrics": {"run_id": "3dd0460d95444370", "mttr": {"value": "2.8m", "seconds": 166.33375668525696, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 166333.75668525696, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 95669.98052597046, "tool_calls": 26, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 25, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 161321.31361961365, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 70085.61062812805}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22892.02070236206, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 133168.1170463562, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10251.77264213562, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

